  "title": "Can I use my HSA for cord blood banking?",
  "summary": "Health Savings Accounts (HSAs) are a powerful tool for managing healthcare expenses, offering families the flexibility to save pre-tax dollars for qualified medical costs. If you’re considering cord blood banking, you may wonder if your HSA can help cover the costs. While HSAs can sometimes be used for cord blood storage, specific conditions must be met for eligibility.",
